#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "django-task-psql"
msgstr "django-task-psql"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"A Postgres-native backend for [Django "
"Tasks](https://docs.djangoproject.com/en/stable/topics/tasks/) "
"(`django.tasks`, Django 6.0+)."
msgstr ""
"一个原生支持 Postgres 的 [Django Tasks](https://docs.djangoproject.com/en"
"/stable/topics/tasks/) 后端（`django.tasks`，Django 6.0+）。"

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid ""
"Django 6.0 introduced an official interface for background task queues "
"(`@task`, `.enqueue()`, pluggable backends via the `TASKS` setting). "
"`django-task-psql` is a production backend for that interface, built "
"specifically for Postgres: real queueing via `SKIP LOCKED`, "
"`LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` wakeup instead of polling, and automatic retries with "
"exponential backoff — no Celery or Redis required."
msgstr ""
"Django 6.0 引入了后台任务队列的官方接口（`@task`、`.enqueue()`，以及通过 "
"`TASKS` 设置实现的可插拔后端）。`django-task-psql` 就是该接口的一个生产级"
"后端，专为 Postgres 打造：通过 `SKIP LOCKED` 实现真正的排队，通过 "
"`LISTEN`/`NOTIFY` 唤醒而非轮询，并支持指数退避的自动重试 — 完全不需要 "
"Celery 或 Redis。"

#: ../../index.md:7
msgid ""
"Built Postgres-only on purpose, trading multi-engine support for tighter "
"integration with Postgres features (see [`django-tasks-"
"db`](https://github.com/RealOrangeOne/django-tasks-db) for a database-"
"agnostic alternative)."
msgstr ""
"刻意只支持 Postgres，以放弃多数据库引擎支持为代价，换取与 Postgres 特性更"
"紧密的集成（如需引擎无关的替代方案，参见 [`django-tasks-db`](https://"
"github.com/RealOrangeOne/django-tasks-db)）。"

